:: Widgets MP NPC Noel [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpInitNpcNoel">>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.noel>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, axis: 0, axisLabel: "共生", spores: 0, gardenTier: 0, trialType: "none", deepStage: 0, sporePages: 0, nextStepDay: 0, setback: 0, rep: 50, weekKey: -1, upkeepWeek: -1, relDay: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.axis is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.noel.axisLabel>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axisLabel to "共生">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.spores is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.spores to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.gardenTier is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.gardenTier to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.noel.trialType>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trialType to "none">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.deepStage is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.deepStage to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.sporePages is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.sporePages to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.nextStepDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.nextStepDay to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.setback is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.setback to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.rep is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.rep to 50>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.weekKey is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.weekKey to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.upkeepWeek is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.upkeepWeek to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.relDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.relDay to 0>><</if>>
<</widget>>

:: MP NPC Noel Deep Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if !$mpNoelEnded and $mpWorldNoelEnding>><<set $mpNoelEnded to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpWorldNoelEnding is "symbiosis">><<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>><<if (_npc.upkeepWeek or 0) isnot _wk>><<set _npc.upkeepWeek to _wk>><<money -20>><</if>><</if>>
<<mpInitNpcCross>>
学园标本室里弥漫着湿苔与甘菊的苦香，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>先搭脉确认你的呼吸，再翻开吊在墙上的厚标本册核对共生刻度 <<print _npc.axis>>、活性孢子 <<print _npc.spores>> 份、药圃 <<print _npc.gardenTier>> 阶与菌株手记 <<print _npc.sporePages>> 页。<<if $mpNpcCrossLast and $mpNpcCrossLast.noel>>标本册夹着「<<print $mpNpcCrossLast.noel>>」。<<else>>荧光菌丝随温气舒展。<</if>><<if $mpWorldNoelEnding is "symbiosis">>温室封锁后每周要单支一笔无烟炭费。<<elseif $mpWorldNoelEnding is "purify">>母株菌群已熬成义诊药，温室孢子结余比从前薄了一成。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[查看作息表 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Schedule]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看温室循环 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Loop]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[查看标本子系统 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Subsys]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_npc.setback or 0)>>
<<link [[查看温室休整木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpNoelEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldNoelEnding is "symbiosis">><<link [[重温共生终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Ending B]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[重温净雾终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Ending A]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>
<<link [[去她现在所在 (0:05)|MP NPC Noel Schedule]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP NPC Noel Quest Waiting [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
标本室里间的玻璃门扣着恒温木栓。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>看了一眼温度计，把银镊放回消毒盘：母株切片只在白昼九点至十七点恒温灯最稳时开皿，且每次施药后都要隔天观察排异脉象。<<if (_npc.sporePages or 0) lt 6 and (_npc.deepStage or 0) lt 5>>册里的菌株手记眼下只记了 <<print (_npc.sporePages or 0)>> 页，还得靠每周试药结算一页页补齐。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回共生深枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[明天再来问一次 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Quest Closed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
温室门把上挂着「熏蒸静养」的白签，玻璃窗内弥漫着石炭酸水雾。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>隔着玻璃轻声叮嘱：上次处置母株失手引发了菌群排异，不仅耗损了活性孢子与标本室声望，这两天温室必须闭门净菌，过两天再来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回共生深枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[过两天再来看看 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Tier Action [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
酒精灯上的药壶冒着洋甘菊白汽，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>合上脉案小册。当前共生刻度停在 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if _npc.axis gte 60 and (_npc.love or 0) gte 20>>她已经在温室里间为你留了一张铺着艾草垫的竹榻，连最珍贵的母株培养皿也准你亲手开启<<elseif _npc.axis gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>>她每次见你都会先配好半杯对症的温茶<<else>>她仍像对待寻常试药学徒那样一板一眼地记脉象，但手法温和了许多<</if>>。
标本室的铜壶冒着细密白汽，玻璃皿里的叶片在恒温灯下泛着微光。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[坐下搭脉问诊 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpNoelTierTalk>><<set $daily.mpNoelTierTalk to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深谈菌群共生记 (0:12)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<if _npc.axis gte 15 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 5>><<if !$daily.mpNoelTierDeep>><<set $daily.mpNoelTierDeep to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 6)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[陪在炉边焙干甘菊 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Daily 15]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Loop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopDay_noel isnot Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopDay_noel to Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_noel to "none">><</if>>
标本台上排开三只无菌玻璃罐，当前活性孢子存有 <<print _npc.spores>> 份，雾潮水尺 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>说同一天只能处理一类活体样本，免得孢子串种污染：要么下暗潮洞穴刮取荧光菌株，要么上瓦沟蒸馏灰雾苔藓，要么留在温室测冷蕨样本；本轮采样<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "fungi">>已锁定荧光菌，灰雾苔藓皿已封口<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "moss">>已锁定灰雾苔，荧光菌洞口已落锁<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "fern">>已锁定冷蕨样本，菌洞与苔藓台都已封存<<else>>选定一类便会关掉另外两类<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "none" or $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "fungi">>
<<mpmushroomicon>><<link [[下洞采荧光菌 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Loop Fungi]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "none" or $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "moss">>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[蒸馏提纯灰雾苔 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Loop Moss]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "none" and !$daily.mpLoopThirdNoel>>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[留在温室测冷蕨叶 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 15>><<set $daily.mpLoopThirdNoel to 1>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_noel to "fern">><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[温室已收工 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Noel Loop Fungi [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "moss">>
恒温箱里的培养皿已经全部装满了蒸馏过的灰雾苔藓，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>拦住你说，因为今日先开了苔藓蒸馏器，屋里的酸碱度偏高，此时带入荧光菌株会立刻引发排异枯死。
<<else>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_noel to "fungi">><<set _npc.trialType to "fungi">>
<<else>>
<<set _already to 1>>
<</if>>
你们钻进学园后山阴冷的防空暗洞刮取荧光菌株，同日灰雾苔藓的蒸馏台随之封闭。幽蓝的孢子粉在指尖浮动，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>提醒你屏住呼吸：活体荧光菌能大幅提升共生刻度，但吸入微量孢子也会引起短暂的耳鸣与刺痛。<<if _already>>这一轮荧光菌已经采过，她只把封好的菌瓶举到灯下让你看清瓶底的青灰沉淀。<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回总台 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "moss">>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看封锁代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<elseif _already>>
<<link [[今日已走过 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpmushroomicon>><<link [[徒手剥取母菌伞 (0:16)|MP NPC Noel Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<if !$daily.mpNoelFungiAct>><<set $daily.mpNoelFungiAct to 1>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 6)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[用铜镊夹入密封瓶 (0:14)|MP NPC Noel Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpNoelFungiAct>><<set $daily.mpNoelFungiAct to 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 4)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Noel Loop Moss [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "fungi">>
蒸馏台的冷凝管已经拆下浸泡在消毒水里，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>指着暗室里的蓝光说，因为今日先采了活体荧光菌，标本室必须保持避光恒温，没法再点火蒸馏灰雾苔藓。
<<else>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_noel to "moss">><<set _npc.trialType to "moss">>
<<else>>
<<set _already to 1>>
<</if>>
你们将瓦沟刮下的灰雾苔藓放进玻璃曲颈甑慢火蒸馏，同日荧光菌的阴冷培养箱随之锁闭。淡绿色的凝露一滴一滴落进量筒，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>盯着温度计：蒸馏苔藓能多得一份纯净孢子液，但长时间守在蒸腾的苦雾旁极耗心神。<<if _already>>这一轮灰雾苔已经蒸馏完毕，她把冷凝管拆下浸进消毒水，只留量筒底的凝露给你看。<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回总台 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "fungi">>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看封锁代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<elseif _already>>
<<link [[今日已走过 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[守曲颈甑收原液 (0:16)|MP NPC Noel Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<if !$daily.mpNoelMossAct>><<set $daily.mpNoelMossAct to 1>><<tiredness 3>><<set _npc.spores += 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 3)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[兑甘菊水调和苦气 (0:14)|MP NPC Noel Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpNoelMossAct>><<set $daily.mpNoelMossAct to 1>><<tiredness 1>><<stress -2>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 3)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Noel Loop Lockout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
空气采样器的浮标停在一格半，玻璃柜的指示灯由绿转红，说明屋里已经浮起孢子尘。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>把两只未封口的培养皿推进消毒柜，又用石炭酸布巾顺纹擦过台面，连缝隙里的孢子囊也一并刮净。墙上那块排班石板被她划掉今日的格，明日的采样名额用粉笔写在最上一行，注明只许开一类活体样本。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回试药总台 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[收样本回深枢 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Loop Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_noel is "fern">><<set _npc.trialType to "fern">><</if>>
今日采集的是<<if _npc.trialType is "fungi">>幽蓝荧光菌株<<elseif _npc.trialType is "moss">>提纯灰雾苔藓<<else>>深涧耐寒冷蕨<</if>>，当前共生刻度 <<print _npc.axis>>，活性孢子 <<print _npc.spores>> 份，菌株手记 <<print _npc.sporePages>> 页。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>在培养皿边缘贴好浸过蜂蜡的防潮封条并记下今日温湿度刻度，抬头问你要收存孢子还是扩建温室药圃。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回共生深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpmushroomicon>><<link [[封存活性孢子 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpLoopSettleNoel>><<set $daily.mpLoopSettleNoel to 1>><<if (_npc.weekKey or -1) isnot _wk>><<set _npc.weekKey to _wk>><<set _npc.sporePages to Math.min(6, (_npc.sporePages or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220 or _npc.axis gte 20>><<set _npc.spores += ($mpWorldNoelEnding is "purify" ? 1 : 2)>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 4)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set _npc.spores += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[提孢子瓶去药圃架 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Subsys]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Subsys [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
玻璃温室里的药圃按层排开：当前为<<if (_npc.gardenTier or 0) gte 3>>三阶母株皿柜，温湿度与光照独立分管<<elseif (_npc.gardenTier or 0) gte 2>>二阶滴灌菌架，竹管将活水一滴不差送入菌瓶<<elseif (_npc.gardenTier or 0) gte 1>>一阶恒温苗床，底层铺着发热的发酵木屑<<else>>零阶空木架，还没铺上保温基质<</if>>。瓶中现有活性孢子 <<print _npc.spores>> 份，每投两份即可扩建一阶。
标本室的铜壶冒着细密白汽，玻璃皿里的叶片在恒温灯下泛着微光。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回共生深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpmushroomicon>><<link [[投入孢子扩建 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Subsys Upgrade]]>><<pass 15>><<if _npc.gardenTier lt 3 and _npc.spores gte 2>><<set _npc.spores -= 2>><<set _npc.gardenTier += 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 5)>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去试药台采集孢子 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Loop]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Subsys Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
新换上的竹滴管发出一声轻响，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>仔细校过温度表。如今药圃已升至<<if (_npc.gardenTier or 0) gte 3>>三阶母株皿柜<<elseif (_npc.gardenTier or 0) gte 2>>二阶滴灌菌架<<elseif (_npc.gardenTier or 0) gte 1>>一阶恒温苗床<<else>>初建苗床<</if>>，剩余活性孢子 <<print _npc.spores>> 份。温室角落的藤椅旁飘着清甜的药草香，正好坐下缓一口气。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回共生深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回药圃页查看 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Subsys]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
