:: MP NPC Noel Scene Finale [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $mpNoelEnded>><<if $mpWorldNoelEnding is "symbiosis">><<goto "MP NPC Noel Ending B">><<else>><<goto "MP NPC Noel Ending A">><</if>><</if>>
母株前，只够续养或整株焚净。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>把火折子与培养液都放在石台。选定就不能回头。
温室滴灌管轻轻作响，培养皿边结着一圈细雾，土腥混着甘菊苦香。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
