<<mplampicon>><<link [[封锁共生境 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Ending B]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpNoeScFinale to 1>><<set $mpNoelIrreversibleChoice to "symbiosis">><<set $mpNoelEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldNoelEnding to "symbiosis">><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Ending A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if $mpNoelEnded and $mpWorldNoelEnding is "symbiosis">><<goto "MP NPC Noel Ending B">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpNoelEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpNoelEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldNoelEnding to "purify">><<set $mpNoelIrreversibleChoice to "purify">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("noel_ending_purify_v50")>><<money 1600>><<set _npc.spores to (_npc.spores or 0) + 2>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
成排贴着白签的净雾药剂送往孤儿院与神殿义诊台，困扰小镇的雾季咳症应声缓解。虽然学长当年窃取署名的事被她淡然翻过，但全城药师都认准了标本室这味方子。自母株菌群剥离熬药后，每次试药结余的活性孢子比从前少了一截。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回共生深枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回诺艾尔处喝茶 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Ending B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if $mpNoelEnded and $mpWorldNoelEnding is "purify">><<goto "MP NPC Noel Ending A">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpNoelEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpNoelEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldNoelEnding to "symbiosis">><<set $mpNoelIrreversibleChoice to "symbiosis">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("noel_ending_symbiosis_v50")>><<money 1600>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
玻璃间成了全城唯一不受寒潮与灰雾侵扰的温润秘境，母株半空的树干里亮着点点荧光。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>把系着红绳的备用钥匙交到你手里，说你的呼吸早已与这里的菌群融为一脉。温室恒温炉从此每周都要单支一笔无烟炭费。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回共生深枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回诺艾尔处喝茶 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Schedule [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>> <<set $location to "town">> <<effects>> <<mpAmbient>> <<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 7 and Time.hour lt 12>>晨间温室里，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>在给母株喷雾，叶背结着细露，喷壶嘴还挂着水珠。
<<elseif Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 18>>午后标本柜开着，她用镊子夹菌丝，玻璃起雾，柜脚压着一册未合的脉案。
<<else>>入夜暖阁灯低，培养皿边上还冒着白气，温度计的红线停在她盯过许多次的刻度。
<</if>>温室滴灌管轻轻作响，培养皿边结着一圈细雾，土腥混着甘菊苦香，草垫还留着白昼的热。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_npc.setback or 0)>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[看休整木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpNoelEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldNoelEnding is "symbiosis">><<link [[回终局乙 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Ending B]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[回终局甲 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Ending A]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>温室滴灌轻轻作响，培养皿边结细雾，土腥混着甘菊苦香往上浮。
<<if Time.hour gte 7 and Time.hour lt 12 and !$daily.mpNoeScMorning>><<mpherbicon>><<link [[帮她喷雾 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Scene Morning]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 18 and !$daily.mpNoeScNoon>><<investigateicon>><<link [[夹菌丝入皿 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Scene Noon]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif (Time.hour gte 18 or Time.hour lt 7) and !$daily.mpNoeScNight>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[守培养皿 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Scene Night]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif !$daily.mpNoeScRest>><<shopicon>><<link [[暖阁歇脚 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Scene Rest]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[去街口走走 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Street 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.deepStage or 0) gte 5 and (_npc.sporePages or 0) gte 6 and !$mpNoelEnded and !$daily.mpNoeScFinale and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpscaleicon>><<link [[在母株前决断 (0:16)|MP NPC Noel Scene Finale]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.sporePages or 0) gte 6 and !$daily.mpNoeScSp6 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[摊齐六页收集 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Scene Page6]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 40 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 40) and !$daily.mpNoeScRel40 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[跟对方进暖阁 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Scene Rel40]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.rep or 50) lt 30 and !$daily.mpNoeScRepLow and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[应付学监盘问 (0:12)|MP NPC Noel Scene RepLow]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.rep or 50) gte 70 and !$daily.mpNoeScRepHigh and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收下花房谢礼 (0:12)|MP NPC Noel Scene RepHigh]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.sporePages or 0) gte 4 and !$daily.mpNoeScSp4 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[继续辨认收集 (0:15)|MP NPC Noel Scene Page4]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 25) and !$daily.mpNoeScRel25 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[并肩靠培养架 (0:14)|MP NPC Noel Scene Rel25]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.sporePages or 0) gte 2 and !$daily.mpNoeScSp2 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[对读两页收集 (0:12)|MP NPC Noel Scene Page2]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 10 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10) and !$daily.mpNoeScRel10 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[接过她递的茶 (0:12)|MP NPC Noel Scene Rel10]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>><<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[核对关系阶位 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Tier Action]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Noel Note [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
你轻轻推开标本室木门时<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>不在桌前，陶茶壶底座下压着一张带洋甘菊香气的药笺便条：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 60>>『我去暗渠口取一份活水样，壶里温着给你配的少蜜洋甘菊茶，玻璃间钥匙在抽屉花萼下，申时或入夜八点回来把脉。』<<elseif (_npc.axis or 0) gte 25>>『去图书馆查一页旧本草，桌上有烘好的茯苓饼，午后归。』<<else>>『外出采药，勿触碰未封口培养皿，傍晚回室。』<</if>>
标本室的铜壶冒着细密白汽，玻璃皿里的叶片在恒温灯下泛着微光。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回作息 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[压好干花笺 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if !$daily.mpNoelNoteSign>><<set $daily.mpNoelNoteSign to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[前往同城交集 (0:06)|MP NPC Cross Noel Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Street 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
牛津街拐角的干货草药摊前，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>正拈起一片晒干的紫苏叶凑在鼻端轻嗅。当前共生刻度为 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 40>>她一转头看见你，立刻放下竹篮先探了探你的脉门，顺手挑了一包安神酸枣仁塞进你怀里<<else>>她仔细挑出掺在药材里的陈年梗枝，示意你帮她拎住布袋口<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回上一页 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[辨认甘菊成色 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetNoel>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetNoel to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[挎上药篮回标本室 (0:12)|MP NPC Noel Loop]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetNoel>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetNoel to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
炭炉上架着一只细竹筛，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>正用竹筷拨动刚采下的洋甘菊花冠。微苦回甘的香气在屋里弥漫，当前共生刻度为 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 35>>她依你的脉象添了两味温肺干花，把香囊系在你衣扣内侧<<else>>她教你听花瓣干燥时的轻响，说火候多一分就散了安神气味<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回关系阶位 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Tier Action]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[焙花冠入药囊 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyNoel15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel15 to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[守着烘炉添炭火 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyNoel15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel15 to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
